 speaking truth to power about COVID pandemic research and treatment. Dr. Robert Malone will update us on the latest science on Covid-19.", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/1/y/n/g/7/yng7h.qR4e-small-VSRF-Weekly-Update-Livestre.jpg", "display_id": "v24j2ks", "fulltitle": "VSRF Weekly Update Livestream EP#64: \"Defeat the Mandates Anniversary\" with Robert Malone, MD", "duration_string": "1:39:24", "upload_date": "20230126", "release_date": "20230127", "release_year": 2023, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777689060, "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/vo/ya1s/WK8zIzxSWkQ/s2LC3LFoEY8.mp4", "format_id": "mp4-720p-1", "fps": 60, "tbr": 2732, "filesize": 2037039676, "width": 1280, "height": 720, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1280x720", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "mp4-720p-1 - 1280x720", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.01.31", "release_git_head": "9a9a6b6fe44a30458c1754ef064f354f04a84004", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}